   <text:h text:style-name="P30" text:outline-level="2"><text:soft-page-break/>Starting Gate <text:span text:style-name="T16">Scene</text:span></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8">If you have <text:span text:style-name="T10">a second camera, consider a view of just the start of the track, so the audience can see the cars as they’re being staged. <text:s/>You might also add an inset of the “On Deck” (see ‘focus_current’, above) or “Now Racing” page. <text:s/>If your track lanes don’t read left to right in this view, consider adding some overlaid lane labels.</text:span></text:p>
